{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-203-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "Excellent! I've successfully resolved INC-203. Here's what I did:\n\n**Problem:** The `verifiedGrossMassTonnes` function was only including cargo weight, missing the container's tare weight, causing VGM declarations to be underestimated by the weight of the container itself.\n\n**Solution:** Updated the function to include both cargo and tare:\n```typescript\n// Before: return Math.round(container.cargoKg) / 1000;\n// After:  return Math.round(container.cargoKg + container.tareKg) / 1000;\n```\n\n**Verification:** All existing tests pass, including the manifest tests. The fix now correctly calculates VGM as specified in the acceptance criteria (e.g., 20000 kg cargo + 2200 kg tare = 22.2 tonnes).\n\n**Commit:** `54a1d5d` - \"Fix INC-203: Include container tare in verified gross mass\"\n\nINC-203 is now complete and ready for deployment.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9KUF21Z7zSb7WV9uoE", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "fe0dd95c-2be7-430e-8e62-f2d84e74fc93", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:41:11.909Z", "type": "assistant"}
